        <mxCell id="runtime_sequence_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Design interface → exact committed call seam&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every native ball/socket is labeled with its concrete Nest service method(s). A label containing several operations maps each listed operation one-to-one to the same provider class; no TypeScript interface is claimed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runtime hand-off&lt;/b&gt; · ingress → normalize / deduplicate / Notification classify → persist + topology context → Notification change → exact membership evaluation → Action operation → conditional Incident classify → Incident + links. Neither classifier selects membership, severity, status, or time bounds." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7AAFC9;strokeWidth=1.3;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#244B61;" vertex="1" parent="processor_boundary">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="3210" width="5000" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
